      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `appClipDefaultExperienceLocalizations` resource represents metadata that appears on your App Clip card, specific to a locale, for a default App Clip experience. For example, use this resource to read and update localized text that appears on the App Clip card.",
